{"version":1,"key":"card:74","content":{"id":74,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"两线程竞争访问共享资源，需要保证并发安全，Peterson 算法如下。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7c73a16b-894e-4f0f-9d79-f489f3413c8c","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"线程如果需要访问共享资源，首先需要举起一面旗子，表示自己需要访问共享资源，并且贴上对方名字的标签，如果满足以下条件则可访问资源：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"80ccf833-aa02-4883-a9ba-c0a31d1833a6","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"只有自己举起旗子，表示没有人竞争，可以直接访问","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e71139d9-070d-4f78-aa23-55a595671e8f","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"adf2e68f-167c-4644-9f7c-db2dfec0ae58","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"都举起了旗子，这时看标签是不是自己的，如果贴的是自己的标签，则可以访问，否则等待","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2debaa4c-58cf-46ef-a588-0d5587798cbb","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"fd54e891-9c26-46e9-88d6-589c86b1fd1f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"4edb7a71-d41f-40d1-baaf-07309eef1957","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"线程访问完资源后，需要将自己的旗子放下，这样别的线程才有机会。否则你举着旗子，标签上写的又是你的名字，别的线程永远没有机会。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"af67f233-3c75-4d84-a554-cf0b84bda75b","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这个算法初读有个很奇怪的点，就是贴标签时贴的是对方的名字，正是这种谦让的机制，避免了竞争，以往都是先来先进，这就会带来竞争，现在是来了先等着，直到对方贴上你的名字。虽然是贴的是对方的名字，但还是先贴标签的先访问资源。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"19045222-b5de-43c3-95e8-31731067e44d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"A，B 举起旗子","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d3bd7db3-9772-46c6-a58d-98100132368d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"385c3edd-8d54-444b-b6fb-5c41261fc582","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"A 先来，贴上 B 的名字，A 等待","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"17188df0-d4e0-4a0e-b855-5b5736e74d6d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2f74f9a1-6008-4216-8314-719728ecc7e1","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"B 后来，将标签上的名字改为 A，B 等待","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f6e33b7e-e355-4646-a4ee-a9e2512e6bba","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"75e06917-9b12-4a5a-8e57-8ea8934c643a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"A 看到标签上是自己的名字，访问资源","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6ddf7c90-3660-4863-ac42-a02fc4bc8369","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9974974e-0e75-41fc-9883-6e1aaae73ba6","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"A 访问资源完毕，撤下自己的旗子","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6c87310a-97f1-4fb4-b040-4784a6d6805e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b9e57629-c3d9-4bf2-889c-4f8cc3e743e0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"此时只有 B 举起了旗子，B 可以访问资源","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"19965e2a-e47f-4365-b95a-885a58bd8f80","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"5108f3b6-bca6-40a8-8913-9b851314269b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"B 访问完资源，撤下自己的旗子","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bfd7a674-1e30-4d66-b1fa-d1886361447d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"0524e25a-d136-47ca-8a1e-ffa95e56b12b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"1ed6e961-3110-4ddb-a32e-fe391e95a27c","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["操作系统/并发"],"createTime":1689167258517,"updateTime":1793532516334,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532516334}}